2) Write a Python program to convert temperatures to and from Celsius and Fahrenheit.
temp = input("Enter the temperature you would like to convert ")
value = int(temp[:-1])
degree = temp[-1]
if degree == "C":
    value = ((9/5) * value) + 32
    print(f"{value}F")
else:
    value = (value - 32) / (9/5)
    print(f"{value}C")


